# Export Pipeline

## PNG Export

### In-Sketch (Keyboard Shortcut)

```javascript
function keyPressed() {
  if (key === 's' || key === 'S') {
    saveCanvas('output', 'png');
    // Downloads output.png immediately
  }
}
```

